.
. Organ definition file format
. .Comment
. #DIVISION - start stoplist for division
. +Stophead - force Stophead to be Dark Red text
. Stophead - (No prefixed character) - Black stophead, but will automatically be set to Dark Red for certain
.            Patterns of text (contains "on", "to", "Octave", "Sub Octave", "Unison Off", "Tremulant"), or
.            Dark Blue (contains "Orage" or "Anches")
. -Stophead - force Stophead to Black text
. *Stophead - force Stophead to Dark Blue text
. 
. Some lines in this file (e.g. Great Rohr Flute 8') are commented and replaced with an 
. alternative to minimize stopheads which are basically for the same stop but where one
. has a unicode character such as an O-Umlaut instead of a U.
